tip Seeping Corruption is done much later, in Azshara and Felwood & Winterspring (54-56): keep its empty vials.
tip Otho in Revantusk wants 10 of these feathers later. Buying them saves farming gryphons at a one-in-three drop rate.
turnin 864
tip Apothecary Zinge works in the Apothecarium.
accept 2995
tip Oran Snakewrithe stands in the Magic Quarter.
fly "Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad" npc 4551

# Into the Hinterlands --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map The Hinterlands
turnin 650
tip From Tarren Mill take the road east past Durnholde Keep up into the Hinterlands. Aerie Peak, the Wildhammer town by the road, is hostile: ride past it. Gilveradin camps by the road east of it.
accept 77

