tip The Jintha'Alor quests and the Call to Arms board are level 50-51 elites: they are done last, on the second loop.

# North along the coast -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 7815 bg
do 580 bg
tip Whiskey Slim's Pupellyverbos Port: small cobalt-blue bottles standing on the shore north and south of Revantusk, a few inside the village; none under water. Turning ground clutter down makes them easy to spot. Booty Bay wants them in a later guide.
do 7840
tip Lard's picnic basket sits on the small island north-east of the big waterfall (around 84,41). Opening it brings three level 49 Vilebranch Kidnappers, each carrying a lunch: each of you kills one. They have Execute, so keep your health above 20%.
do 7815
tip The Saltwater Snapjaws crawl along the whole coast between Revantusk and the island.
do 580

# Shaol'watha, the wilds and Skulk Rock --------------------------------------------------------------

do 7844 bg
do 7828 bg
do 7829 bg
do 3123 bg mobs 2929 2928 2927
tip Every kind of owlbeast counts. Loot the owlbeast first, then target its corpse and use the Wildkin Muisek Vessel (the corpse vanishes). The vessel has a 30-second cooldown and works on the other player's kills too.
do 7830 bg
tip Razorbeak Skylords are a kind of gryphon, not one named beast: several roam with the wolves and owlbeasts south of Skulk Rock, south of the road (around 53-55,48-50).
tip Keep every Long Elegant Feather the gryphons and Skylords drop: Otho wants 10 later.
do 7839
tip The tools are a small bucket at one of five spots at a time: on top of Skulk Rock (53.3,38.8), 57.4,42.6, the troll forts at 66.4,44.7 and 71.0,48.6, or the ruins at 72.6,53.0. You can look into the forts from outside; check each as you pass.
do 77
tip The Horde Supply Crates hold one to three bottles each. Most are inside Skulk Rock's cave (the centre pit, the east room, the top of the ramp right of the entrance), one just outside its entrance (57,38). They respawn in about five minutes.
do 7828
do 7829
do 3123 mobs 2929 2928 2927
do 7830

# Quel'Danil Lodge ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 7841 bg
tip The scouts and outrunners roam the front of the lodge and the field beside it; the rangers and marksmen keep to the back, inside, and by a gazebo at the lake. Rangers cast Faerie Fire, so you can't slip away from them.
do 2995.1
tip The records and the notes lie on the ground around the lodge, the report on a table.
do 2995.2
do 2995.3
accept 2742
tip Rin'ji is locked in a cage by the lake at the back of the lodge. Clear the way out before you free him. If he is gone, someone just took him: wait for him to come back.
do 2742 at 34.6,56.3 "Escort Rin'ji out of Quel'Danil Lodge"
tip Two groups of three elves jump you on the way out, and he likes to walk into owlbeasts. When he nears Shadra'Alor he runs off on his own: that's the end of it.
do 7841
turnin 77
accept 81
tip Ripple Delivery is for a later guide: keep the barrel.

# Hiri'watha, the river and the Altar of Zul ------------------------------------------------------------

accept 2933
tip The green Venom Bottles lie on the ground in the troll camp south of Gilveradin's; clicking one starts the quest.
do 98203
tip Ti'ik is in a cave west of Hiri'watha. He hits hard: fight him together. His head drops for only one of you per kill, so wait the three minutes for him to come back and kill him again.
do 2641
tip The Violet Tragan is a mushroom at the bottom of Valorwind Lake (around 40,60), north-west of the Altar of Zul: dive for it. Don't eat it.
do 7844.2
tip The Altar of Zul is full of Soothsayers and Scalpers. The Scalpers have Execute: keep your health above 20%. Stay around the base: two level 50 elites stand at the top. Spawn points change kind, so kill everything; the river forts at Shaol'watha have more.
do 7844.1 at 46.4,66.6
hearth npc 14731

