# Jintha'Alor -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 7850 bg
do 7862 bg
tip The Soul Eaters keep to the second terrace, the Berserkers the third, the Blood Drinkers and Shadow Hunters the fourth and fifth.
do 7849.1
tip The Pile of Skulls is on the top level of Jintha'Alor, the same as the priestess: turn right at the top, past a walled area with trolls, into the wolf pen (around 58,65). Pull one wolf; you can loot the skull beside the other. Every troll here is elite: pull one at a time.
do 7862.1
do 7862.2
do 7849.2
tip The Pile of Bones lies in the middle of the slime pit, one level below the top (around 62,75).
do 7862.3
do 7862.4
do 7850
tip The Vessels of Tainted Blood stand all over the terraces.
turnin 7845
tip Elder Torntusk is chained at the top of Jintha'Alor.
accept 7846
do 7861.1
tip Vile Priestess Hexx walks around the altar at the very top; clear the guards first. Her hex is a heavy damage-over-time spell she can cast again and again: dispel or heal through it.
do 7846
tip Hitah'ya the Keeper is at the back of the cave behind the altar: take the middle tunnel, keep to the left wall (the right one is a dead end), and go up a level to a room with a green pillar. About a dozen Aman'zasi guards stand on the way, which finishes that kill count. She walks with two guards that come together: three elites at once.
do 7861.2
