# The OOX robot and Rin'ji's secret ----------------------------------------------------------------

accept 485 at 49.4,37.7 "Use the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon"
tip The beacon drops rarely from any mob here, and each of you needs one. If neither of you has one, skip ahead to Rin'ji's secret.
turnin 485
accept 836
do 836 at 79.1,61.4 "Escort OOX-09/HL to the shore beyond Overlook Cliff"
tip The robot sits on the biggest island of the lake west of Skulk Rock. It walks east to the coast; stay with it. When it calls out danger, ride ahead and take the ambush off it: three owlbeasts (46) south of Skulk Rock that enrage when low (kill one at a time), then three Vilebranch Ambushers (47) in the woods north of Jintha'Alor that execute below 20%. Both of you must hand in Find OOX-09/HL! before either accepts the escort.
turnin 2742
tip Rin'ji's secret is a big stone tablet on the little island with a stone arch off the coast (86,59), about due east of the path down to the turtle beach, not on the cliffs the quest names: swim to it.
accept 2782

